Line blocks

```
::: |
Roses are red,
Violets are blue.
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>Roses are red,<br>
Violets are blue.</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
Roses are red,
  Violets are blue.
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>Roses are red,<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;Violets are blue.</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
Stanza one,
still one.

Stanza two.
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>Stanza one,<br>
still one.</p>
  <p>Stanza two.</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
*Bold* and /italic/,
plain line.
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p><strong>Bold</strong> and <em>italic</em>,<br>
plain line.</p>
</div>
```

```
::: {.line-block}
one
two
:::
.
<p>::: {.line-block}
one
two
:::</p>
```

```
::: \
one
two
:::
.
<div class="hardbreaks">
  <p>one<br>
two</p>
</div>
```

```
:::: \
  indented
next

::: note
a
b
:::
::::
.
<div class="hardbreaks">
  <p>indented<br>
next</p>
  <aside class="admonition note">
    <p>a
b</p>
  </aside>
</div>
```
